ur drawing! I think your drawings are very pretty! I would like to request artwork for a certain character.\n\nHis name is PallyCallie and he is a tennis playing emperor penguin Vtuber. He is always happy, energetic and outgoing.\n\nWe want him to be happy and cute. Pose, facial expressions, etc. are all up to you.\n\nIf possible, I would like to have the signature on a separate layer, I will post it on Twitter and Twitch.\n\nThank you so much!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/KP5oF1e", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@S27uCo/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2648054, "client_id": 2382562, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b758c6c3/uploads/origins/983c008d-df9c-45c1-8ae6-3ac9cf4fb974?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=50a23af4ec469112032889ee9b448ecc", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b758c6c3/uploads/origins/983c008d-df9c-45c1-8ae6-3ac9cf4fb974?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=50a23af4ec469112032889ee9b448ecc, https://si.imgix.net/b758c6c3/uploads/origins/983c008d-df9c-45c1-8ae6-3ac9cf4fb974?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=40729606e1259ae4e42a6bcb02bf3545 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b758c6c3/uploads/origins/983c008d-df9c-45c1-8ae6-3ac9cf4fb974?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87ffdfc0ad97e9951755cd04b74688eb 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b758c6c3/uploads/origins/983c008d-df9c-45c1-8ae6-3ac9cf4fb974?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0d77aeccf6c0144195be52444411e3f9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b758c6c3/uploads/origins/983c008d-df9c-45c1-8ae6-3ac9cf4fb974?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm